{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_073590","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你知道《2001：太空漫游》这部电影吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不，没看过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那可是部好电影……宇宙场景的<R=特效,SFX>很厉害，对AI的描写也非常出色。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=特效,SFX>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"AI？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":5,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"嗯，叫HAL，是控制宇宙飞船的AI，在故事里也扮演着重要角色。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"Strangelove也很喜欢这部电影。我跟你说过我和她在哥斯达黎加重逢时的事吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"没有。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"她不是很讨厌男人吗？明明是自NASA之后久别重逢，却完全聊不起来……可一提到HAL，她突然就健谈起来了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":142,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"她说话的方式真的很有知性。对那部晦涩电影的解读、洞察，还有谈起AI时的热情……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":113,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"我又一次被她迷得神魂颠倒。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"这么说来，得为给我和她牵线搭桥的HAL干一杯！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"你也可以和她聊聊《2001：太空漫游》。肯定就能明白她有多棒。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"她有多棒啊……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"HAL这名字真不错啊……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""}]}